 slug:'birthday-party-ideas',categoryPath:'celebrations/birthday-parties',title:'20 Birthday Party Ideas for Every Age, Budget & Vibe',dek:'A practical birthday idea list organized by the kind of experience you want to create—not just by what looks good in a saved photo.',readTime:'15 min read',seoTitle:'20 Birthday Party Ideas for Every Age, Budget & Vibe',seoDescription:'Explore 20 birthday party ideas by budget, age, setting and activity, with practical planning notes and links to age-specific party guides.',image:'/launch-media/birthday-party-ideas.png',imageAlt:'Editorial graphic for birthday party ideas',socialImage:'/launch-media/birthday-party-ideas.png',
