 slug:'12-year-old-birthday-party-ideas',categoryPath:'celebrations/birthday-parties/by-age',title:'15 Birthday Party Ideas for 12 Year Olds, From Chill to Active',dek:'Twelfth birthday ideas for pre-teens who want something fun and social without a party that feels too young.',readTime:'10 min read',seoTitle:'15 Birthday Party Ideas for 12 Year Olds, From Chill to Active',seoDescription:'Explore birthday party ideas for 12 year olds, from movie nights and sleepovers to active games, creative activities and outdoor plans.',image:'/launch-media/12-year-old-birthday-party-ideas.png',imageAlt:'Editorial graphic for 12 year old birthday party ideas',socialImage:'/launch-media/12-year-old-birthday-party-ideas.png',
 blocks:[h(1,'Twelve needs a little more social space'),p(1,'At 12, the party can still include games and planned activities, but the group may care more about music, photos, food and friend time. One anchor activity plus flexible hangout usually works better than a packed schedule.'),h(2,'Chill party ideas'),idea(1,'Movie night','Shortlist, snacks and comfortable seating.','Low','4–10 friends','Indoor'),idea(2,'Sleepover','Movie, snack bar, one optional game and breakfast.','Low to medium','3–7 friends','Home'),idea(3,'At-home cafe','Simple drinks, pastries and playlist.','Low','4–8 friends','Indoor'),idea(4,'Game lounge','Multiple quick games rather than one long game.','Low','4–10 friends','Indoor'),idea(5,'DIY dessert bar','Decorate and eat the dessert.','Low to medium','4–10 friends','Indoor'),h(3,'Creative party ideas'),idea(6,'Paint night','Loose prompt, canvases and snacks.','Low to medium','4–8 friends','Indoor'),idea(7,'Charm / bead bar','Pre-sort materials in trays.','Medium','4–8 friends','Indoor'),idea(8,'Photo scavenger hunt','Safe creative prompts, small teams.','Low','6–12 friends','Indoor / outdoor'),idea(9,'Mini zine night','Photos, drawings and captions.','Low','4–8 friends','Indoor'),idea(10,'Bake-and-decor','Use a simple recipe or pre-baked items to keep timing manageable.','Low to medium','4–8 friends','Indoor'),h(4,'Active party ideas'),idea(11,'Backyard tournament','Three games and easy rotations.','Low','8–16 friends','Outdoor'),idea(12,'Bowling','Good for mixed groups and clear timing.','Medium','6–12 friends','Venue'),idea(13,'Skating','Confirm ability, rentals and session rules.','Medium','6–12 friends','Venue'),idea(14,'Park picnic + games','Blankets, food and two lawn games.','Low','6–14 friends','Outdoor'),idea(15,'Backyard movie + pre-show game','One active game before the movie starts.','Medium','6–12 friends','Outdoor'),h(5,'Bridge toward teen-party planning'),p(2,'If the birthday child already prefers teen-style plans, borrow from the teen guide: smaller friend groups, one main activity, photo moments and more unstructured time.'),internal(1,'Ready for the teen version?','The teen pillar covers movie nights, sleepovers, outdoor ideas and more milestone-style plans.','See teen birthday party ideas','/article/teen-birthday-party-ideas'),faq(1,sharedFaq)]
